<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ meta.title }}</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 16mm 15mm 16mm 15mm;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "Noto Sans CJK KR", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    color: #23262b;
    font-size: 10.3pt;
    line-height: 1.62;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  @media screen {
    html { background: #e9ecef; }
    body {
      width: 210mm;
      min-height: 297mm;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 16mm 15mm;
      background: #fff;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
  }

  .doc-header { border-bottom: 2.5px solid #16233b; padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 30px; width: 100%; }
  .doc-header-table { width: 100%; border: none; }
  .doc-header-table td { vertical-align: bottom; border: none; padding: 0; }
  .doc-header-logo { text-align: right; width: 220px; }
  .doc-header-logo img { height: 38px; width: auto; opacity: 0.88; }
  .doc-header .eyebrow { font-size: 8.6pt; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d97706; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .doc-header h1 { font-size: 21pt; font-weight: 700; color: #16233b; line-height: 1.2; }
  .doc-header .subtitle { font-size: 10pt; color: #5b6472; margin-top: 8px; }

  .intro { background: #f6f7f9; border-left: 3px solid #16233b; padding: 13px 18px; font-size: 9.6pt; color: #3c4048; margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.7; white-space: pre-wrap; }

  .section { margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .section-title { border-left: 4px solid #d97706; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .section-title h2 { font-size: 13.5pt; font-weight: 700; color: #16233b; display: inline; }
  .section-title .note { font-size: 8.8pt; color: #9aa1ab; font-weight: 400; margin-left: 8px; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; page-break-inside: auto; break-inside: auto; }
  thead { display: table-header-group; }
  tfoot { display: table-footer-group; }
  thead th { text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 8.1pt; letter-spacing: 0.4px; color: #7a828d; background: #f6f7f9; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 9px 12px; }
  tbody td { border-bottom: 0.75px solid #eceef1; padding: 11px 10px; vertical-align: top; font-size: 9.7pt; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  tbody tr { page-break-inside: avoid; break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: auto; }
  tbody tr td { page-break-inside: avoid; break-inside: avoid; }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  td.service { color: #23262b; font-weight: 500; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  td.target  { color: #565c65; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  td.date    { color: #4a5057; white-space: nowrap; }
  td.action  { color: #565c65; white-space: pre-wrap; }

  .col-service { width: 20%; }
  .col-target  { width: 22%; }
  .col-badge   { width: 13%; }
  .col-date    { width: 13%; white-space: nowrap; }
  .col-action  { width: 32%; }

  .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 7.6pt; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 3px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .badge-eol    { background: #fdecea; color: #b3261e; }
  .badge-eos    { background: #eef1fd; color: #4148b0; }
  .badge-ga     { background: #e6f0ff; color: #1257c4; }
  .badge-preview{ background: #fff3e0; color: #b45309; }
  .badge-custom { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; border: 0.5px solid #cbd5e1; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.3; word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; }

  .section-new { page-break-before: always; }
  .new-item { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 0.75px solid #eceef1; page-break-inside: avoid; break-inside: avoid; }
  .new-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .new-item .row1 { display: table; width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .new-item .row1 .title { display: table-cell; font-weight: 700; color: #16233b; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: middle; }
  .new-item .row1 .title .badge { margin-left: 7px; }
  .new-item .row1 .date { display: table-cell; text-align: right; width: 80px; color: #9aa1ab; font-size: 8.8pt; vertical-align: middle; white-space: nowrap; }
  .new-item .body { color: #4a5057; font-size: 9.7pt; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .new-item .url { font-size: 8.4pt; margin-top: 6px; word-break: break-all; }
  .new-item .url a { color: #0071e3; text-decoration: none; }
  .new-item .url a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .footer-note { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 12px;  font-size: 8.4pt; color: #9aa1ab; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="doc-header">
    <table class="doc-header-table" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
      <tr>
        <td class="doc-header-left">
          {% if meta.eyebrow %}<div class="eyebrow">{{ meta.eyebrow }}</div>{% endif %}
          <h1>{{ meta.title }}</h1>
          <div class="subtitle">작성 {{ meta.written }} · MSP</div>
        </td>
        {% if logo_src %}
        <td class="doc-header-logo">
          <img src="{{ logo_src }}" alt="Logo">
        </td>
        {% endif %}
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  {% if meta.customer_intro %}
  <div class="intro">{{ meta.customer_intro }}</div>
  {% endif %}

  {%- macro render_url(url) -%}
    {%- if url -%}
      <div class="url"><a href="{{ url }}" target="_blank">{{ url }}</a></div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endmacro -%}

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>서비스 종료 예정 (EOL · EOS)</h2>
      <span class="note">— 운영 중 서비스 종료 · 변경, 사전 조치 필요</span>
    </div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th class="col-service">서비스</th>
          <th class="col-target">대상 버전 · 항목</th>
          <th class="col-badge">구분</th>
          <th class="col-date">종료 · 변경일</th>
          <th class="col-action">전환 대상 · 조치</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in eol_eos %}
        <tr>
          <td class="service">{{ item.service }}</td>
          <td class="target">{{ item.target or "—" }}</td>
          <td class="badge-cell">
            {% if item.badge %}
              {% for b in item.badge.split(',') %}
                {% set bt = b.strip() %}
                {% set bl = bt|lower %}
                {% if bl in ['eol','eos','ga','preview'] %}
                  <span class="badge badge-{{ bl }}">{{ bt|upper }}</span>
                {% else %}
                  <span class="badge badge-custom">{{ bt }}</span>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td class="date">{{ item.date }}</td>
          <td class="action">{{ item.action | format_bullets | safe }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-new">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>핵심 서비스 업데이트</h2>
      <span class="note">— 주요 코어 서비스 신규 기능 요약</span>
    </div>

    {% for item in whats_new %}
    <div class="new-item">
      <div class="row1">
        <div class="title">
          {{ item.title }}
          {% if item.badge %}
            {% for b in item.badge.split(',') %}
              {% set bt = b.strip() %}
              {% set bl = bt|lower %}
              {% if bl in ['eol','eos','ga','preview'] %}
                <span class="badge badge-{{ bl }}">{{ bt|upper }}</span>
              {% else %}
                <span class="badge badge-custom">{{ bt }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if item.date %}<div class="date">{{ item.date }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if item.body %}<div class="body">{{ item.body | format_bullets | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      {{ render_url(item.url) }}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="footer-note">
      최신 정보는 AWS 공식 페이지를 참고해 주세요.
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
